## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design tenant-scoped progressive delivery, alignment with SRE practices, and Google-native tooling.

## Key Concepts
- Per-tenant rollout
- Region-aware routing
- Cloud Deploy traffic controls
- Cloud Monitoring per-tenant SLIs
- Safe rollback

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo routing logic (illustrative only)
function routeRequest(req){
  const tenant = req.headers['x-tenant'];
  const region = mapTenantToRegion(tenant);
  const targetRevision = selectRevision(tenant, 'v2');
  forwardTo(region, targetRevision, req);
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you model SLOs per tenant?
- How would you handle tenants migrating regions or throttling during a spike?

## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design production-grade canaries with data-plane shadowing and multi-service integrations using Google-native tooling.

## Key Concepts
- Canary deployments with per-revision traffic
- Shadow traffic for data validation
- Pub/Sub driven sinks to BigQuery
- Cloud Monitoring alert policies and auto rollback
- Least-privilege IAM

## Code Example
```javascript
// Example: emit prod request and publish shadow copy
async function handle(req){
  const prodResp = await prodEndpoint(req);
  await publishShadow(copyRequest(req));
  return prodResp;
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you ensure idempotency and avoid double writes if shadow sink duplicates fail?
- How to test rollback safety and prevent drift between prod and shadow data?

